<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!Lead.FirstName},</font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Prior to our first call, I thought it would be productive to cover a few of the basics, so that we can spend our time talking in more depth and determine if we would be a good fit for you as a company, and if you would be a good fit for us as a client.</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">1. Memphis Invest offers fully turnkey properties in Memphis, Dallas, Houston, Oklahoma City, and Little Rock. We purchase distressed properties, rehab them way beyond your typical rental property, and then we offer them to our clients for purchase. We also do all of our own property management, so as soon as the property is finished with rehab our rental team begins showing the property to prospective residents.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="">2. We define ourselves as a portfolio management company, and that means that we work exclusively with clients who are building portfolios. Given our price points, this means that each new client needs to have $100k in cash available to deploy on their first two properties in order to get started.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">3. We manage 4500+ single family (exclusively- we do not do MF) properties, and we do not manage outside properties that were not purchased from us. We want to devote our management resources towards taking care of the clients who invested with us.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">4. The most common reasons that I hear as to what was the difference when a current client decided that we were the right fit for them and they wanted to invest with us is that we have the best reputation and the most experience in the industry. In an industry where most other companies are less than 5 years old, being around almost 15 years now makes us the "grey hairs" in the room, and that's a great thing. We've been through multiple economic cycles and we know exactly what we are doing.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">5. The second most common reason why clients choose us is that we make it so simple for them to build a passive income portfolio across 5 different markets, all with streamlined communication through one point of contact (us!). Whether you own 5 properties in 1 of our markets, or 1 property in each of our 5 markets, you can almost never tell the difference because of how seamless make the investment experience.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">6. Our price points are almost exclusively between $100-200k. Memphis, Little Rock, and Oklahoma City are typically $100-150k, and Dallas and Houston are typically $150-200k.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">7. The typical cash on cash return on our properties net of insurance, taxes, and property mgmt fees is 6-7%, and the average leveraged net return is between 8-14% depending on the property and the financing structure taken on by the client.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">8. Our property management company is most likely the best in the entire United States. Our average resident stays 4.5-5 years after intially signing a two year lease. Almost 90% of our residents extend their lease at least one time beyond the first two years.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">7. Our average vacancy rate is around 3%, and our average maintenance per property is around 4% of gross rents. The industry average is close to twice as high.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">8. We have everything an out of state investor could ever need to build their portfolio with us, including financing partners (both 20% down conventional lenders and non-recourse lenders for those looking to leverage a self-directed IRA or solo 401k). If you have a pre-existing relationship with a lender who has already closed an out-of-state investment property purchase for you, then that might be an option for you to use as well.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">That is a lot to process, I know, and I apologize for such a long email. However, I have found that the more you know about us prior to our first call, the more productive that first call will be.</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Thanks, and looking forward to speaking with you.</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Marq</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><br class="Apple-interchange-newline"><br></div><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">--&nbsp;</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><div class="gmail_signature" data-smartmail="gmail_signature" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div style="border-collapse: separate; font-family: georgia, serif;"><a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bea0-baba97f6-16a5bdc5-baba97f6-00000003-akh1jtljgb2avjcra3athdno4hnubpbd&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1" target="_blank" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);"><img src="https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/VocC3c2w1i6HUluWpOvtxOAa5qF2zGJEuSJO-lUHv6cCFTVdcsZfyi4asNB_Zq6julHgKskY6uTvxhB6lEaov2si393M4vZBlKNwFgfd6_dBzQwV-TBsgIlJSImkDO4E0DqWebkrX65tQZyx0nwNdYOKo6fSj4okMuw5hwZNj4BUrTREXVFbJTWicYLRAP8cbRjkBqMHVgRqEgNuCrbi6A=s0-d-e1-ft#https://docs.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1uTcA6Utb6kWjhoLr2_vrSEJZXYzTeHGo&amp;revid=0B6FqHnQBLWozL3pMbWZoTzBOZlJyTFZkK1oveDYydDN1MWxNPQ" width="420" height="275"></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
